---
import Base from "../layouts/Base.astro";
---
<Base title="About · cacheleon" description="About cacheleon and how this site is hosted.">
  <h1>About</h1>
  <p>How this site works:</p>
  <ul>
    <li>Built with <a href="https://astro.build">Astro</a> into plain HTML.</li>
    <li>Pushed over SSH to a bare git repo on a Raspberry Pi 5.</li>
    <li>A git hook builds it and copies the result into nginx's web root.</li>
    <li>Cloudflare Tunnel brings it to the internet, with no open ports.</li>
  </ul>
</Base>
